# Backend Rules

Read @.cursor/skills/architecture/references/backend-structure.md and @docs/api-contract.md.

- Use module-first Express/Mongoose folders.
- Keep route wiring in `*.routes.ts`.
- Keep HTTP translation in `*.controller.ts`.
- Keep business rules in `*.service.ts`.
- Keep persistence in `*.model.ts`.
- Validate input at the route boundary with Zod.
- Register modules through `backend/src/http/routes.ts`.
- Use shared response helpers and the documented API response shape.
